<view class="card">
  <view class="title">技师入口</view>
  <view class="muted tip">本入口供技师使用，绑定后在这里接单、看排期与上报定位。顾客请回首页下单。</view>
  <view class="link" bindtap="goCustomerHome">我是顾客，回首页</view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="field">
    <text class="label">手机号</text>
    <input
      class="input"
      type="number"
      maxlength="11"
      placeholder="与档案登记的手机号一致"
      value="{{phone}}"
      bindinput="onPhoneInput"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="field">
    <text class="label">工号</text>
    <input
      class="input"
      placeholder="选填，由店主在后台开通"
      value="{{staffNo}}"
      bindinput="onStaffNoInput"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="muted tip">工号由店主在后台「技师管理」里开通；手机号必须与档案一致，两项对不上就无法绑定。</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <button
    class="button-primary submit"
    bindtap="submit"
    loading="{{submitting}}"
    disabled="{{submitting}}"
  >绑定技师身份</button>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="muted">绑定失败时常见原因：手机号或工号与档案不一致、档案还没被店主设为在岗、档案仍在审核中。以上情况请联系店主处理。</view>
</view>
